dsh-agency-market README · Roadmap：1. **Remote registry**: pull the catalog from remote JSON with in-market updates;
2. **Continuable expert sessions**: a card button that starts a continuable expert child session the parent can @ anytime;
3. **Rich cards**: usage counts / authors / versions / sample conversations; card sorting (popular/latest).

dsh-agency-market README · Development：- `src/index.js` — host entry (dual-inject wiring);
- `src/experts.js` — catalog loading (head + split files + overlays) and install/uninstall/state;
- `src/routes.js` — the three same-origin HTTP routes;
- `src/summon.js` — the two summon tools + prompt section;
- `client/client.js` — market page + composer button + `@` trigger source;
- `scripts/import-agency-agents.mjs` — import/re-import the catalog from agency-agents;
- `scripts/merge-zh-overlay.mjs` — merge zh translation fragments;
- `scripts/smoke.mjs` — offline smoke checks.
